1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,040
So this is a Rust based implementation

2
00:00:03,040 --> 00:00:05,970
based on rust-dashcore that is a full

3
00:00:05,970 --> 00:00:11,050
node, full masternode compatible implementation

4
00:00:11,050 --> 00:00:12,910
