5
00:00:12,910 --> 00:00:15,090
There have been a number of bugs both

6
00:00:15,090 --> 00:00:17,910
in rust-dashcore as well as in Dash Core

7
00:00:17,910 --> 00:00:21,830
itself that we've identified from this process.

8
00:00:22,230 --> 00:00:23,790
There were a couple of bugs actually

9
00:00:23,790 --> 00:00:27,970
that were fixed in 23.1 patch versions

10
00:00:27,970 --> 00:00:32,910
that had some severity attached to them.

11
00:00:33,290 --> 00:00:35,830
And we only found them thanks to this

12
00:00:35,830 --> 00:00:38,350
