14
00:00:39,910 --> 00:00:43,410
And actually just on the 22nd, we had

15
00:00:43,410 --> 00:00:46,610
the first rdashd testnet masternode

16
00:00:46,610 --> 00:00:49,230
registered and it is still registered.

17
00:00:49,230 --> 00:00:51,310
So this masternode has been on the

18
00:00:51,310 --> 00:00:54,090
